[al:新概念英语第二册]
[ti:2. Breakfast or Lunch]
[00:00.520]Passage 2 | 文章二
[00:01.860]Breakfast or lunch? | 早餐还是午餐？
[00:05.470]It was Sunday. | 那是星期天。
[00:08.485]I never get up early on Sundays. | 我从不在星期天早起。
[00:12.205]I sometimes stay in bed until lunchtime. | 我有时会一直睡到午饭时间。
[00:16.325]Last Sunday, I got up very late. | 上个星期天，我起得很晚。
[00:21.085]I looked out of the window. | 我朝窗外看去。
[00:23.585]It was dark outside. | 外面一片漆黑。
[00:26.665]What a day, I thought. | “这是什么日子啊，”我想。
[00:29.845]It's raining again. | “又下雨了。”
[00:32.645]Just then, the telephone rang. | 就在那时，电话响了。
[00:36.510]It was my aunt Lucy. | 是我的露西阿姨。
[00:39.605]"I've just arrived by train," she said. | “我刚乘火车到了，”她说。
[00:43.735]"I'm coming to see you." | “我要来看你。”
[00:46.475]"But I'm still having breakfast," I said. | “可是我还在吃早饭呢，”我说。
[00:51.220]"What are you doing?" she asked. | “你在做什么？”她问。
[00:54.570]"I'm having breakfast," I repeated. | “我在吃早饭，”我重复道。
[00:59.500]"Dear me," she said. | “天啊，”她说。
[01:02.335]"Do you always get up so late?" | “你总是起这么晚吗？”
[01:05.040]"It's one o'clock." | “现在都一点钟了。”